Z||000000||Gokart||01-16-2000||03:25 PM||||Can someone tell me where the heck I can get a T-35 torx bit?! With my GT off the road now I'm going to remove/repaint the plenum. Went to 2 autoparts stores and 3 hardware stores and nobodys got them or can't even order one!! They all go from T-30 to T40!||||reg||5
Z||000001||cobra427||01-16-2000||04:06 PM||||hey neighbor,  why don't you try either the Snap On tool truck or the Mac Tools truck.<BR>Ralph Peterson drives the truck for Snap On. <BR>Maybe you could call him. This is an old number,not sure if it will get you there but you can try it.  775-6334<BR>Andy Sugg=Mac Tools 508-240-3201||||reg||1
